# BSDM-Proxy PAC bypass list
#
# One domain per line. A domain matches itself and every subdomain.
# Use ASCII/punycode for internationalized names; raw Unicode is rejected.
# Leading "." or "*." and a trailing dot are normalized away.
# The file is reloaded without restarting the proxy.
#
# Examples:
# ozon.ru
# vseinstrumenti.ru
# xn--e1afmkfd.xn--p1ai
